# Clips with sparse keys on a curve through their keys (reports/engine/2026-11-13-smooth-sampling/README.md): each take
# twice in one run, first on straight lines between the keys as before (`sample off`, takes `*-line`), then on the
# curve (`sample on`, takes `*-curve`). The hero says lines of his original voice to Xardas in the tower of the default
# save with one dialog gesture the bench names (T_DIALOGGESTURE_03, 08, 09, 06: ten keys a second), seen whole from the
# front: the camera does not follow the head, so the arms and the trunk are judged, and the head as the trunk carries
# it. The nod and the sway of the voice are off. Then clips of the whole body from the side, for the feet, each played
# to its end before the next take so that both takes show the same frames: standing with a sword drawn (the stance
# S_1HRUN, a loop), looking the sword over (T_1HSINSPECT), sitting down and getting up (T_STAND_2_SIT) - ten keys a
# second - and a dance (T_DANCE_01: fifteen keys a second, the root travels a metre).
# CSV: an_hand, an_head, an_chest - the change of the step of the hands, the head and the chest between two frames, cm;
# sm_on. No AI server. How to run it and make the clip - scripts/bench/README.md, "Anim smooth clip".
# @timeout 420
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
view clean 30
overlay off
gestures param Nod 0
gestures param SwayYaw 0
gestures param SwayRoll 0
watch nearest
freeze nearest
wait 500
place 110 0
wait 800
watch player
cam front 150 140
cam look 125
wait 1500
sample off
gestures pick 3
rec g3-line
wait 700
speak player DIA_Addon_Xardas_Hello_15_01 NONE_100_XARDAS
wait 6500
stop
wait 1500
sample on
gestures pick 3
rec g3-curve
wait 700
speak player DIA_Addon_Xardas_Hello_15_01 NONE_100_XARDAS
wait 6500
stop
wait 1500
sample off
gestures pick 8
rec g8-line
wait 700
speak player DIA_Addon_Xardas_Hello_15_01 NONE_100_XARDAS
wait 6500
stop
wait 1500
sample on
gestures pick 8
rec g8-curve
wait 700
speak player DIA_Addon_Xardas_Hello_15_01 NONE_100_XARDAS
wait 6500
stop
wait 1500
sample off
gestures pick 9
rec g9-line
wait 700
speak player DIA_Addon_Xardas_Hello_15_01 NONE_100_XARDAS
wait 6500
stop
wait 1500
sample on
gestures pick 9
rec g9-curve
wait 700
speak player DIA_Addon_Xardas_Hello_15_01 NONE_100_XARDAS
wait 6500
stop
wait 1500
sample off
gestures pick 6
rec g6-line
wait 700
speak player DIA_Addon_Xardas_Hello_15_01 NONE_100_XARDAS
wait 6500
stop
wait 1500
sample on
gestures pick 6
rec g6-curve
wait 700
speak player DIA_Addon_Xardas_Hello_15_01 NONE_100_XARDAS
wait 6500
stop
gestures pick
wait 1500
# the whole body, from the side on the flat floor of the tower
goto NW_XARDAS_TOWER_IN1_26
cam follow 300 90 90
equip ItMw_1h_Mil_Sword
wait 800
tap weapon
wait 3000
sample off
rec stance-line
wait 5000
stop
sample on
wait 500
rec stance-curve
wait 5000
stop
sample off
wait 500
rec inspect-line
wait 500
ani player T_1HSINSPECT
wait 10500
stop
wait 1500
sample on
rec inspect-curve
wait 500
ani player T_1HSINSPECT
wait 10500
stop
wait 1500
tap weapon
wait 3000
sample off
rec sit-line
wait 500
ani player T_STAND_2_SIT
wait 5500
stop
goto NW_XARDAS_TOWER_IN1_26
wait 2000
sample on
rec sit-curve
wait 500
ani player T_STAND_2_SIT
wait 5500
stop
goto NW_XARDAS_TOWER_IN1_26
wait 2000
sample off
rec dance-line
wait 500
ani player T_DANCE_01
wait 12000
stop
goto NW_XARDAS_TOWER_IN1_26
wait 2000
sample on
rec dance-curve
wait 500
ani player T_DANCE_01
wait 12000
stop
